<mp-popup show="{{show}}" position="bottom" bind:close="handleCancel">
  <view class="popup-container">
    <view class="popup-header">
      <div class="popup-header-name">近30天任务状况</div>
      <div class="popup-header-close" bindtap="handleCancel"></div>
    </view>
    <view class="popup-content">
      <view class="popup-content-title">一、已触达</view>
      <view class="popup-content-text">
        <view class="right-desp">企业内，近30天通过任务沟通被触达的顾客</view>
      </view>
      <view class="popup-content-title">二、未触达</view>
      <view class="popup-content-text">
        <view class="right-desp"
          >企业内，近30天未出现在沟通任务名单中的顾客，或出现在任务名单中但未被触达的顾客</view
        >
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>
</mp-popup>
